      "markdown": "Combining this with Eq. (S27) and thus using _λx_ + ∆ _λx,V · ∥x − y∥_ as a probabilistic upper bound for _λz_ , we obtain the following results for all _y_ with _∥x − y∥≤ rx_ :",
