      "markdown": "_≤_ ( _λx_ + ∆ _λx,V · rx_ ) _· rx_ � _≥_ 1 _− γ_ As _rx_ defined like in Eq. (S15) is the solution of the quadratic equation _µ · m_ ¯ _j,V − dj_ ( _x_ ) = _λxrx_ + ∆ _λx,V rx_<sup>2,</sup> it holds that:",
