      "markdown": "We now distinguish between two cases for _y_ : (a) _dj_ ( _y_ ) _≤ dj_ ( _x_ ) and (b) _dj_ ( _y_ ) _≥ dj_ ( _x_ ). In case (a) it is trivial: _dj_ ( _y_ ) _≤ dj_ ( _x_ ) _≤ µ · m_ ¯ _j,V_ . Having case (b), Eq. (S29) is equivalent to",
